<<set $wordCount = 15>>
Ah, there you are. 
I was getting worried that you weren’t going to show up.
===

title: Interaction2
---
<<set $wordCount = 20>>
It’s alright. 
I ordered for you, I hope that’s okay. 
You liked the salmon last time we were here, correct?
===

title: Interaction3a
---
<<set $wordCount = 76>>
Well, you ate all of it last time, 
so I figured you liked it.
Do you ever hear from Trinity from high school? 
I ran into her mom a couple nights ago 
at the Phipp’s over on Shelby and Clark and you’ll never guess it 
but apparently they barely speak anymore. 
She wouldn’t tell me the reason 
but I can’t say it came as a shock. 
That girl was always running about and disrespecting her parents. 
It’s just terrible though, 
treating her poor mother like that.
===

